    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials - Chapter One, is a choose your own adventure, horror visual novel.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d08dce9149fdf730be6518c01c1c8cea.avif?t=1755508500\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter One is a complete  story, that will become part of a bigger world. Each Chapter will be a stand alone adventure that can be played in any order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own choices to try and escape your trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 30 endings, and find the secret Hidden Ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many deaths await you, but don't be discouraged, you can try again. There must be some safe paths... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d44225a1253291e24e481018f9504457.avif?t=1755508500\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/227b9df4eaa1f266e75b46c2401cd21d.avif?t=1755508500\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials - Chapter One, is a choose your own adventure, horror visual novel.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d08dce9149fdf730be6518c01c1c8cea.avif?t=1755508500\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter One is a complete  story, that will become part of a bigger world. Each Chapter will be a stand alone adventure that can be played in any order. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/538e63d0f9b18907443f406740941b2c.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your own choices to try and escape your trial. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/48e75e17c57483d303d48030cace2bba.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 30 endings, and find the secret Hidden Ending!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.poster.avif?t=1755508500\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/489f1813c6a3072d8cdb3a2daae3af54.webp?t=1755508500\" class=\"bb_img\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many deaths await you, but don't be discouraged, you can try again. There must be some safe paths... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/d44225a1253291e24e481018f9504457.avif?t=1755508500\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568470/extras/227b9df4eaa1f266e75b46c2401cd21d.avif?t=1755508500\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A classic choose your own adventure story. Escape the horrors hunting you, make decisions, forge your own path. An original complete story with multiple endings and secrets to unlock. Choose your own play style with a Text Adventure Mode, sound effects, and an ambient soundtrack.",
